C. 6 MANDATORY STEPS FOR LLD DESIGN

1. Clarify requirements

=> Functional: Register member, add book, search book, issue book, return book, calculate fine.
=> Non-Functional: Fast search, track due dates, prevent invalid operations.
=> Assumptions: Single library, simple fine (₹10/day), max 5 books per member.
=> Edge Cases: Book not available, max limit reached, late return, invalid member.

2. Identify entities and relationships

=> Main entities : Library, Member, Book, BookItem (copy), IssueRecord
=> Key relationships :
Library has Books and Members.
Book has multiple copies (BookItem).
IssueRecord links Member + BookItem + dates.

