E. POSSIBLE FOLLOW-UP QUESTIONS FROM INTERVIEWER (WITH ANSWER)

Q1. How do you handle multiple copies of the same book?
Answer: I used Book (catalog) and BookItem (physical copy). This allows multiple copies with individual status.

Q2. How do you calculate fine?
Answer: In IssueRecord, compare returnDate with dueDate and charge ₹10 per day.

Q3. How would you scale this for a large library?
Answer: Move to a database with proper indexing on book title and member ID. Use Redis for caching frequently searched books.